installatore-apk (1.0.7-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Translate the package description to Italian and drop the English
    variant so every software centre shows the Italian text.
  * Use the requested orange download icon inside an orange rounded
    square for the installation progress indicator.
  * Add the installatore-apk CLI: without arguments it uses the single
    .apk file found in the current directory.
  * Show the app icon in the header bar and match the desktop entry to
    the com.simonecompany.installatoreapk application id so the system
    bar no longer shows a generic icon.
  * Show a green check with "Fatto!" when the installation completes.
  * Remove the project website link from the window and the README.

